{"l":7590,"g":8,"b":2,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'She ___ the race if she hadn't fallen.'","o":["would have won","would win","had won","will have won"],"a":"would have won","r":"Betingelse type 3 om fortiden: 'if she hadn't fallen' giver 'would have won'."},
